Z||000000||My7Fieros||12-28-2001||07:12 PM||||I love playing w/my new digital camera! Anyway there was a thread last week or so about Fiero models...heres some pics of mine. Post or repost your model pics here..doesnt have to be Fieros!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indymodel1.jpg"> <BR>I ordered the Fieor Pace Car decals for the model off eBay...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indymodel2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indymodel3.jpg"> <BR>This model was orginally an 85 Se..I "doctored" it up to look like an Indy..note the 4 banger engine I put in it in lew of the 6 banger..it even mated right up to the 6 cyl model tranny! (I took the air cleaner off for better engine viewability.)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indymodel4.jpg"> <BR>Another one...silver w/v8<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SEmodel1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SEmodel2.jpg"> <BR>Note the engine..its a 400 V8 out of a 77 Trans Am model..it also mated up perfectly w/ the stock Fiero model tranny.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SEmodel3.jpg">  <P>||||reg||7
